<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><style>
      *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
      body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;padding:40px}
      h1{font-size:24px;margin-bottom:4px}
      .title{font-size:13px;color:#555;margin-bottom:15px}
      .section{margin-bottom:16px}
      .section-title{font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:11px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;padding-bottom:4px;margin-bottom:8px;color:#333}
      .item{margin-bottom:8px}
      .item-title{font-weight:600}
      .item-sub{color:#666;font-size:10px}
      p{text-align:justify;margin-bottom:6px}
      ul{margin:4px 0;padding-left:16px}
    </style></head><body>
      <h1>TRIAS ZAEN MUTAQIN</h1>
      <div class="title">Cloud Consultant | Infrastructure Engineer</div>
      <p>iaszaen@gmail.com  | 0817 - 0190 - 467  | Bekasi, Jawa Barat</p>
      <p>I have experience in cloud infrastructure, particularly with Red Hat OpenStack Platform (RHOSP), and am quite proficient in Linux administration using RHEL and CentOS. I am also familiar with middleware technologies such as Red Hat Fuse and Keycloak. I have recently expanded my knowledge to public cloud platforms like AWS and am eager to explore further. In addition to my infrastructure background, I have knowledge in backend development using Java with Spring Boot and JavaScript with NextJS, including building and managing APIs through API Management tools like WSO2.</p>
      <div class="section"><div class="section-title">Experience</div><div class="item"><div class="item-title">Cloud Consultant at PT Inovasi Informatika Indonesia</div><div class="item-sub">2023-04 - Present</div><p>Manage and maintain Red Hat OpenStack Platform (RHOSP) clusters in production environments for enterprise clients. Perform routine health checks and develop custom monitoring scripts to ensure cluster stability and performance. Execute monthly preventive maintenance to minimize downtime. Troubleshoot infrastructure issues and resolve support tickets. Develop Method of Procedure (MOP) documentation for infrastructure changes and improvements.</p></div><div class="item"><div class="item-title">Middleware Consultant at PT Inovasi Informatika Indonesia</div><div class="item-sub">2022-10 - 2023-04</div><p>Implemented and configured Keycloak as an Identity & Access Management (IAM) solution on Linux Server. Configured Realm, Client, Token, and Identity Provider according to application requirements. Implemented and tested Single Sign-On (SSO) for mobile and website applications. Performed application onboarding for internal and client applications. Supported Keycloak integration into applications by customizing login flows. Troubleshoot Linux-based applications and infrastructure related to authentication and authorization.</p></div><div class="item"><div class="item-title">Technical Consultant at PT Prosigmaka Mandiri</div><div class="item-sub">2022-06 - 2022-09</div><p>Learn Java fundamentals and backend development using Spring Boot. Build REST APIs and database integration. Learn basic Linux and Docker.</p></div></div>
      <div class="section"><div class="section-title">Skills</div><p>Programming Languages: Java, JavaScript, PHP</p><p>Frameworks: Spring Boot, Next.js, Laravel</p><p>Cloud & Infrastructure: Red Hat OpenStack Platform (RHOSP), OpenShift Container Platform</p><p>DevOps & Containerization: Docker, Git, Linux Administration</p><p>Middleware & Identity Management: Keycloak, WSO2 API Manager, Red Hat 3Scale, Red Hat Fuse, Red Hat JBoss</p><p>Database: MySQL, Firebase</p><p>Operating Systems: Red Hat Enterprise Linux (RHEL), Ubuntu Server</p></div>
      <div class="section"><div class="section-title">Projects</div><div class="item"><div class="item-title">Backend REST API</div><p>Developed RESTful API using Spring Boot framework. Implemented CRUD operations and modular backend architecture.</p><div class="item-sub">Java Spring Boot & MySQL</div></div><div class="item"><div class="item-title">Mobile Learning Application</div><p>Build Android applications with Firebase Authentication and database integration.</p><div class="item-sub">Java & Firebase</div></div><div class="item"><div class="item-title">Website Wedding Invitation</div><p>Developed a responsive wedding invitation website using Next.js and Firebase.</p><div class="item-sub">Next.js & Firebase</div></div></div>
      <div class="section"><div class="section-title">Certificates</div><p>AWS Certified Solutions Architect - Associate - 2023-06</p><p>Google Professional Cloud Developer - 2023-01</p></div>
